            <div xml:id="d521-a1">

                <pb facs="1403" n="1397" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1397"/>

                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cooper</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States Dispatch Agent,<lb/>Post-office Building,
                        San Francisco, Cal.</hi></p>
                <p>Forward following by first steamer to A. S. Willis, United States minister,
                    Honolulu:</p>
                <p>“If American citizens were condemned to death by a military tribunal, not for
                    actual participation in reported revolution but for complicity only, or if
                    condemned to death by such a tribunal for actual participation but not after
                    open, fair trial, with opportunity for defense, demand delay of execution, and
                    in either case report to your Government evidence relied on to support death
                    sentence.”</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
